  "limits": [
    "No author model-specific allocation supplement was in selected source inventory. Froese1996 regional checklist/FishBase1998 CD was not recovered; Table3.1 remains a family-level source summary.",
    "Very low analogues for 28 formerly unresolved taxa remain approximations, especially deep/oceanic Berycidae/Bramidae/Lampris/Lepidocybium and family/genus Congridae/Latidae/Plotosidae. The shallow Java Sea model does not establish whole-LME, habitat-depth or year-specific validity.",
    "Congridae 22/23/26 is a disclosed closest-source pike-conger analogy, not an exhaustive modern family membership claim. An additional Small demersals garden-eel alternative was raised but not conclusively resolved with recovered focal-source/native evidence in this bounded review. Its Very low membership and habitat/size mismatch remain explicit.",
    "Native source size criteria use average OR maximum lengths; Table3.1 family representatives and provider size bins do not resolve measured catch-stage composition.",
    "Review is bound to the three exact refreshed hashes. Later evidence revisions require a new comparison; canonical integration and final scientific approval are outside this bounded review."
  ],
